    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The spice must flow: The Tipline for 1 April 2026</title>
      <link>https://globalcompetitionreview.com/gcr-usa/article/the-spice-must-flow-the-tipline-1-april-2026</link>
      <description>Spices may not be as valuable on Earth as they are for Paul Atreides on Arrakis. But spice and seasoning giants McCormick and Unilever have announced plans to merge into a $60 billion “global flavour powerhouse”. Also in Tipline, Agri Stats agrees to alter its meatpacking benchmark reports to settle private litigation involving turkey, chicken and pork.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://globalcompetitionreview.com/gcr-usa/article/the-spice-must-flow-the-tipline-1-april-2026</guid>
